tem_assets/steam/apps/1721270/extras/118bad522f163c3eb39b8da97da96a6b.poster.avif?t=1645709504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721270/extras/118bad522f163c3eb39b8da97da96a6b.webm?t=1645709504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721270/extras/118bad522f163c3eb39b8da97da96a6b.mp4?t=1645709504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
